The event-detection logic in discord-notify.ts is adapted from cmd-mod-completion-bell
(https://github.com/timuela/commandcode-mods), which is licensed under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) timuela1997. That upstream work established which Command Code events
indicate the agent is blocked awaiting a human; this project reuses that mapping and
replaces its local audio playback with a Discord webhook delivery path.

